@UTF8
@Begin
@Languages:	eng, spa
@Participants:	CHI Target_Child
@ID:	eng|corpus|CHI|||||Target_Child|||
@Comment:	Authored nested controls combining word-level emphasis and [e]
	exclusion with explicit code-switch scopes. Inner word scope overrides the
	group only for that word; the following word resumes the enclosing scope.
*CHI:	<hello [!] there [e]> [!] after .
*CHI:	<hello [@s:eng] hola> [@s:spa] after .
*CHI:	<hello <there> [!]> [e] after .
@End
